  "summary": "天同事业宫不能一概断无用，须合命身格局、吉煞及实际工作；古注举空命原文曰月疑字会照、巨门亥命太阳对照等例外。盘二男命巨门亥命、天同卯事业丙禄被作者解释为安享，若无祖业又不努力则不利，但并非所有同类配置必然如此。",
  "summary_en": "Tian Tong in Career is not automatically useless: Life and Body configurations, other stars and actual work must be considered. Classical exceptions include an empty Life Palace with the uncertain source wording Yue Yue, or Ju Men at Hai opposed by Tai Yang. In Chart Two, a male native has Ju Men in Hai Life and Tian Tong in Mao Career with Bing-year Hua Lu, interpreted as ease rather than initiative. The adverse reading depends on lacking inherited support and unwillingness to work, not the placement alone.",
